  answer="Cartier service blends dress-watch cosmetics with modern automatic calibers — costs vary widely by model family and whether cosmetic refinishing is requested. Typical service intervals mirror other fine automatics: roughly 5–7 years for frequent wear, sooner if the watch is exposed to moisture, impacts, or magnetism."
