>
  <p>
    Cartier watches punish sloppy case work: screws mar, bezels distort, and bracelets show uneven
    brushing fast. Shelton Watch Services prioritizes controlled hand skills and conservative finishing —
    especially on watches that spend as much time under cuffs as on wrists.
  </p>
  <h2>Dress vs. sports Cartier</h2>
  <p>
    Tanks and dress calibers often need restraint; Santos and larger sports models may need tougher
    testing plans. Intake matches the watch’s reality — not the catalog category alone.
  </p>
  <h2>When cosmetics matter as much as timing</h2>
  <p>
    If you care about dial patina, we document it. If you want refresh, we map what can be improved without
    erasing character — before abrasives touch steel or gold.
  </p>
